PROJECTS
360° Fashion Try-On with AR/VR & Generative AI	2025
Built a 360° virtual try-on system integrating 3D body pose estimation and generative diffusion models to render photorealistic garment overlays on user avatars from multiple viewing angles.
Engineered a real-time rendering pipeline combining ControlNet-based pose conditioning and NeRF-style view synthesis to handle occlusion, lighting variation, and fabric deformation.
Reduced latency for garment overlay inference by 40% through model quantization and GPU-accelerated inference, making it deployable in mobile AR shopping environments.
Technologies: Python, PyTorch, Diffusion Models, ControlNet, 3D Pose Estimation, OpenCV, AR/VR, ONNX
BHUJAL-NETRA – Real-Time Groundwater Evaluation Platform	2025
Developed a full-stack groundwater monitoring and forecasting platform for 5,260+ DWLR stations across India; reached Local Finals at Smart India Hackathon 2025.
Implemented multi-model forecasting pipeline using LSTM for short-term water level prediction and Pastas + Water Table Fluctuation model for recharge estimation; LSTM model achieved RMSE of 0.18m over a 30-day prediction horizon.
Delivered a Flutter mobile app with multilingual AI chatbot, policymaker dashboard, research portal, and GIS-based region-wise groundwater classification map.
Technologies: Python, LSTM, Pastas, Flutter, Firebase, Matplotlib, Google Maps API
OCEP – Object Communication Error Predictor	Jan 2026
Designed an interactive Streamlit dashboard for uploading research datasets, visualizing software quality metrics, and predicting object communication errors using ML classifiers.
Implemented ensemble ML prediction pipelines with feature importance visualization, achieving reliable software reliability analysis on benchmark datasets.
